        "authorName": "NULL JSFX",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Remote for DAWs"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Your DAW's mixer, transport and NULL JSFX plugins on your phone or tablet."
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Remote for DAWs puts your DAW's mixer and transport, and the controls of every NULL JSFX plugin, on your Android phone or tablet, over your local Wi-Fi. It works with REAPER, Ardour and Mixbus, Bitwig Studio, Ableton Live, Cubase and FL Studio, and, as a Mackie Control surface (beta), with other DAWs such as Logic Pro, Studio One, Pro Tools, Cakewalk and Reason.\n\n<b>What it does</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Mixer: volume, pan, mute, solo, record arm and meters for every track.</li>\n<li>Transport: play, pause, stop, record, repeat, go to start.</li>\n<li>FX: the chain of every track. NULL JSFX plugins (JSFX, GFX, VST3 and CLAP) get their own knobs, sliders and buttons; any other plugin gets a list of its parameters. Add, move, bypass and remove FX.</li>\n<li>Finds REAPER on your network, remembers the computers you used, and works with a password.</li>\n<li>Keeps the screen on while you work, optional full screen.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>What REAPER needs</b>\nTurn on REAPER's web interface (Preferences > Control/OSC/web). For the FX, run the small script null_jsfx_remote_bridge.lua that comes with NULL JSFX. The mixer and transport work without it.\n\n<b>The other DAWs</b>\nArdour and Mixbus: turn on their OSC control surface. Bitwig Studio, Ableton Live, Cubase and FL Studio: install the small script for it that comes with NULL JSFX (Remote folder). Cubase and FL Studio are reached over network MIDI: a network MIDI session on the computer (built into macOS; rtpMIDI on Windows).\n\n<b>Mackie Control (beta)</b>\nFor any other DAW that supports a Mackie Control: the app plays one over network MIDI, with nothing to install in the DAW. Eight tracks at a time with banks, the master fader, mute, solo, record arm, pan, meters, the transport and the time; no plugins. Not yet tried with every DAW.\n\nPart of NULL JSFX (https://nulljsfx.tech): free, MIT licensed, no ads, no tracking, no account. Privacy: https://nulljsfx.tech/privacy/ REAPER, Ardour, Mixbus, Bitwig Studio, Ableton Live, Cubase, FL Studio, Mackie Control, Logic Pro, Studio One, Pro Tools, Cakewalk and Reason are trademarks of their owners; this app is independent and is not made or endorsed by them.\n"
        },
